**Ivarsk** is a town on the spine roadway, south of [[romanikha|Romanikha]]. It is the home of the [[keepers|Keepers]] and the [[hollow-horde|Hollow Horde]]. Most initiates get sent here for there training. The entire town has evolved around this business.

